	<names>
		<name lang="en">EK1100 EtherCAT coupler, 2 x RJ45</name>
		<name lang="fr">EK1100 coupleur EtherCAT, 2 x RJ45</name>
	</names>
	<elementInformations>
		<elementInformation name="manufacturer" show="1">Beckhoff</elementInformation>
		<elementInformation name="manufacturer_reference" show="1">EK1100</elementInformation>
		<elementInformation name="designation" show="1">EtherCAT coupler, 2 x RJ45</elementInformation>
		<elementInformation name="description" show="1">EtherCAT coupler: the upper RJ45 socket is the EtherCAT input (EtherCAT IN), the lower one the output towards further EtherCAT devices (EtherCAT OUT); supply terminals 1 Us +24 V DC, 2 Us 0 V, 3 Up +24 V DC, 4 Up 0 V; three power contacts (24 V, 0 V, PE) on the right face. The position of the terminals and of the LEDs (Us, Up, Run, L/A IN, L/A OUT) is assumed. The label is the island id.</elementInformation>
	</elementInformations>
	<informations>Author: QElectroTech contributors
Generic layout, drawn from the public description of the product, not copied from a manufacturer drawing. License: see http://qelectrotech.org/wiki/doc/elements_license
Schematic view made by misc/beckhoff/gen_hubs.py: the stages between the sockets are generic. License: see http://qelectrotech.org/wiki/doc/elements_license</informations>
